&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced product design director who will build out an already high-caliber group of designers and help shape the product experience for all our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote position based in the United States or Canada. Relocation assistance will not be provided for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
