&lt;li&gt;Track implementation progress, participation, product adoption, and account health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run training sessions, demonstrate Samsara’s technology, and work through challenges with customers and day-to-day users of the system across numerous use cases&lt;/li&gt;
