&lt;p&gt;Your role will be cross-functional in nature, working alongside and connecting Sales, Support, Sales Engineering, and Product, enabling you to experience multiple aspects of a hyper-growth company from within.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates residing in the US &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;except&lt;/span&gt; the San Francisco Bay Metro Area, NYC Metro Area, and Washington, D.C. Metro Area. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
