&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has strong bias for action, the ability to think big, with insistence on high standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience serving a large and complex customer base in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in an unstructured, fast-paced, and change-heavy environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is well-versed in one of the following: cloud software, networking, automation, or control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience with integration projects — at minimum, able to comprehend RESTful APIs; experience with scripting languages like Python is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
