&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is open to candidates residing in the US &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;in the Pacific Time Zone&lt;/span&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
