&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orchestrate the efforts of cross-functional teams — including Creative, IT, PMM, Campaigns, and front-end development — to execute strategic launches, awareness campaigns, website updates, and other digital initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders to define desired website functionality and appearance; lead the development team through product development stages and into live deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work effectively with external agency providers, consultants, and contractors as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Process &amp;amp; Documentation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Document website development processes and procedures; establish and scale best practices across the digital program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Introduce mitigation tactics to minimize project delivery risks and drive continuous improvement across programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of project management experience at a digital agency and/or internal digital department with a primary focus on digital&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with project management tools and methodologies (e.g., Airtable, Jira, Google Sheets) and experience with Google Suite, Salesforce, and Tableau&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience integrating AI tools into program management processes to increase efficiency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of the digital production process, timelines, and scoping requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience launching digital solutions, including ongoing analysis and continuous product improvements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working knowledge of the technical software development process and Agile delivery methods, including Scrum and/or Kanban&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outstanding organizational, communication, and interpersonal skills — written, verbal, and presentation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to work effectively with agency providers, consultants, contractors, and other external suppliers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
