&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt; At Samsara, we win together, celebrate together and support each other. You&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;will be surrounded by a high-calibre team that will encourage you to do your best.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver world-class business partnership to our Chief Marketing Officer and other executives across our Marketing department to inform strategic decisions and maintain accurate near-term and long-term financial operating plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform data-driven analysis to identify, evaluate and execute on value creation initiatives, investment opportunities and risk mitigation strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Marketing, Sales and Engineering operations teams to plan and execute complex cross functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable processes and systems and utilize AI tools to enhance financial visibility, control and planning effectiveness to support durable growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and track key internal and external metrics to guide operational impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze financial results, prepare monthly and quarterly management reporting and lead monthly operating review meetings with VP and EVPs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop and lead an inclusive, engaged, and high performing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ideal candidate has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of finance &amp;amp; strategy, strategic finance or FP&amp;amp;A experience, preferably partnering with go-to-market organizations at a high growth technology company. Experience in investment banking or big 4 accounting is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong initiative, intellectual curiosity and willingness to take ownership of complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence decision making at the executive level, distill key concepts and be articulate in presentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced environment, able to prioritize across multiple projects and adapt to business changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise working with AI, systems and automated reporting tools (Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Databricks, Open AI, Salesforce, Adaptive, Tableau, NetSuite, Workday)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The range of annual base salary for full-time employees for this position is below. Please note that base pay offered may vary depending on factors including your city of residence, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. This role is also eligible for an initial RSU grant with no vesting cliff, and ongoing refresh opportunities tied to performance, subject to plan terms and conditions. Learn more about our total rewards and benefits below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$118,720&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$212,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
